      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Use this after you cancel a video Dreamina has already accepted, after a run times out, or after ComfyUI restarts while a video is being made. Dreamina keeps making it and bills it, and the pack keeps a record of it.\n\n1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. In **Collect**, choose the video in `generation`. Each entry shows the start of its ID, its model, and when it started, in UTC. Press R to list videos started after the page loaded.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/dreamina`.\n\nA video leaves the list once it is saved. If Dreamina no longer has its record, the node says so, and you can look for the video on your Dreamina canvas."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        810,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        142
      ],
