          "link": null,
          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini makes a four-second `720p` clip from the prompt inside **Shot**. **Shot** ships turned off, so a run here makes nothing new and bills nothing. To make a video to recover, select **Shot**, press Ctrl+B to turn it on, press **Run**, and cancel once **Shot** has started. Then turn it off again, choose the video in **Collect**, and run.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. **Collect** downloads it."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
